From: Marcin Radomski <marcin@mradomski.pl>
Date: Wed, 20 Mar 2024 16:56:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Don't rename errno to libc_errno

See b/331344966 for status of the efforts to upstream this.

Change-Id: Ied4890f9a6217c627624daa33d98b1bb78081bba
---
 Cargo.toml                           | 16 ++++++----------
